# Reels Studio

Read `skills/reels-studio/SKILL.md` in full before using it.

Quick reference:
- Setup once: `bash skills/reels-studio/scripts/setup.sh` (`--fonts` to install Cairo); prove it: `bash skills/reels-studio/scripts/selftest.sh`.
- Gates: brief (scope + audience confirmed) → live trend scan (dated) → idea board (`rs.sh score`) → hooks → spec (`rs.sh new --template …`) → `rs.sh validate` (0 errors; `--strict` before delivery) → reviewer checklist → `rs.sh render --formats pdf,docx,teleprompter,production,srt` → look at the PDF → user review → hand-off.
- Write how the audience speaks: `references/languages-dialects.md` (Egyptian: ده/مش/إزاي/هـ, English terms with الـ).
- Content types (`brief.content_type`): `reel` (hook ≤ 3 s), `ad` (`references/ads.md` — placements, ratios, `cutdowns`, `posting.ad_copy`), `long_form` (`references/long-form.md` — `chapter` on scenes, title options + thumbnails). Templates: `rs.sh new --list`.
- House style: `brand: neoai` — blue = editor, dark red = talent; `color_mode: mono` = all-blue variant.
- Production: AI video → flow-studio-director (`*_for_production.txt`); shoot/edit/voice/captions → creative-studio; other languages → transcreate here, subtitles → premium-subtitle-localization.
